     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">請教各大先進:<div>                         如何可以一起修改資型態，例如&quot;新北市鼻頭港服務區&quot;及&quot;11500&quot;更改為 新北市鼻頭港服務區 及 11500 ，就是取消&quot;&quot;。</div><div>                          麻煩再請幫忙解答，非常謝謝!</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-TaW6zER7lHs/WeTXmbv9p2I/AAAAAAAA0VY/j4alVm_2t_AYxiyNZR4kD_p7yy7EJUbnwCLcBGAs/s1600/%25E8%25B3%2587%25E6%2596%2599%25E5%259E%258B%25E6%2585%258B.jpg\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-TaW6zER7lHs/WeTXmbv9p2I/AAAAAAAA0VY/j4alVm_2t_AYxiyNZR4kD_p7yy7EJUbnwCLcBGAs/s1600/%2525E8%2525B3%252587%2525E6%252596%252599%2525E5%25259E%25258B%2525E6%252585%25258B.jpg&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237556164000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0M3rYWYx1BRS5-YjRbwWzA\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-TaW6zER7lHs/WeTXmbv9p2I/AAAAAAAA0VY/j4alVm_2t_AYxiyNZR4kD_p7yy7EJUbnwCLcBGAs/s1600/%25E8%25B3%2587%25E6%2596%2599%25E5%259E%258B%25E6%2585%258B.jpg\" border=\"0\"></a></p><div><br></div></div></blockquote></div></div>"
